+        <div class="pipeline-step"><div class="step-label">Input</div><div class="step-value" id="pipeInput">Text</div></div>
+        <div class="pipeline-arrow">→</div>
+        <div class="pipeline-step"><div class="step-label">Tokenizer</div><div class="step-value" id="pipeTokens">Tokens</div></div>
+        <div class="pipeline-arrow">→</div>
+        <div class="pipeline-step"><div class="step-label">Transformer</div><div class="step-value">Encoder</div></div>
+        <div class="pipeline-arrow">→</div>
+        <div class="pipeline-step"><div class="step-label">Pooling</div><div class="step-value">Mean</div></div>
+        <div class="pipeline-arrow">→</div>
+        <div class="pipeline-step"><div class="step-label">Output</div><div class="step-value" id="pipeOutput">384-d vector</div></div>
+      </div>
+      <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px">
+        Sentence Transformers 使用 WordPiece tokenizer 将文本分割为 tokens，经过多层 Transformer 编码后，
+        对所有 token 的输出取平均值 (mean pooling)，得到一个固定维度的向量表示。
+      </div>
+    </div>
