+What is the primary purpose of practical reasoning according to the lecture?,"['WHAT IS PRACTICAL REASONING? •Practical reasoning is reasoning directed towards actions — the process of figuring out what to do •Practical reasoning is a matter of weighing conflicting considerations for and against competing options, where the relevant considerations are provided by what the agent desires/values/cares about and what the agent believes (Bratman) •Distinguish practical reasoning from theoretical reasoning – directed towards belief 3', 'LEARNING OUTCOMES At the end of this lecture, you should be able to: •Describe practical reasoning •Relate practical reasoning with intentions 2', '•Human practical reasoning consists of two activities: •The interplay between beliefs, desires and intentions defines how the model worksCOMPONENTS OF PRACTICAL REASONING 4DELIBERATION •deciding what situation, we want to achieve •the outputs of deliberation are intentionsMEANS -ENDS REASONING •deciding how to achieve these states of affairs •the outputs of means -ends reasoning are plans', 'SUMMARY •We have define practical reasoning. •We acknowledge how intentions are key part of practical reasoning. •How intention relates to practical reasoning •Intentions are stronger than desire •Next → Means -ends Reasoning/Planning 9', 'IMPLEMENTING PRACTICAL REASONING AGENTS •𝒫{Bel} is the power set of beliefs •Bel is the set of all possible beliefs that an agent might have PROBLEM: •deliberation and means -ends reasoning processes are not instantaneous \uf0df Cost •So the agent selects an intention to achieve that would have been optimal at the time it observed the world •The world may change in the meantime 11']","According to the context, the primary purpose of practical reasoning is to figure out what to do, which involves weighing conflicting considerations for and against competing options, based on an agent's desires, values, and beliefs.",Practical reasoning is reasoning directed towards actions — the process of figuring out what to do.,1.0,0.8790633413291099,0.7555555555303703,1.0
