+What does the filter function in option generation and filtering do?,"['OPTION GENERATION AND FILTERING OPTION GENERATION FILTERING The agent generates a set of possible alternatives The agent chooses between competing alternatives, and commits to achieving them Represent option generation via a function, options(), which takes the agent’s current beliefs and current intentions, and from them determines a set of options In order to select between competing options, an agent uses a filter() function Desires Intentions options : 𝒫(Bel) × 𝒫(Int) ➝ 𝒫(Des) filter :']","Based on the context, the filter function in option generation and filtering selects between competing options. It takes the agent's desires and intentions as input and returns a set of options that align with the agent's goals and intentions. In other words, the filter function filters out options that do not match the agent's desires and intentions, leaving only the options that are compatible with the agent's goals.","In order to select between competing options, an agent uses a filter() function.",0.2857142857142857,0.9043031735872683,0.9999999999,1.0
+What is the representation of the goal in the STRIPS planning system?,"['MEANS-ENDS REASONING / PLANNING • Planning: The design of a course of action that will achieve some desired goal • Basically, give a planning system representation of: • goal/intention to achieve; • actions it can perform; • the environment; • and generate a plan to achieve the goal 3 Let the system figure out how to achieve the goal on its own!', 'REPRESENTATION } 4 • goal to be achieved • state of environment • actions available to agent • plan itself Represented by logic The Stanford Research Institute Problem Solver (STRIPS): an automated planner used by Shakey Use first-order logic and theorem proving to plan strategies from start to goal']","In the STRIPS planning system, the representation of the goal is given in first-order logic.","Represented by logic, the STRIPS planning system uses first-order logic and theorem proving to plan strategies from start to goal.",1.0,0.9950576047215746,0.49999999995,1.0
