 the system interacts with these actors • What the system is supposed to do • Then, we associate accordingly • Roles responsibilities and capabilities • Interaction patterns between agents 5']","Based on the context provided, the three key features of an agent are not explicitly stated. However, the lecture discusses the following aspects related to agents:
