+What is the primary goal of modern AI according to the lecture?,"['FROM AUTOMATION TO COLLABORATION • Traditional AI = Task automation • Follows fixed rules and performs predefined tasks • Efficient but limited by human instructions • Modern AI = Goal-driven collaboration • Understands goals and adapts to user needs • Uses reasoning and creativity to co-create solutions • Collaboration replaces command-and-control • AI acts as a partner, not just a tool 18', 'SUMMARY • This lecture has looked in detail at what constitutes an intelligent agent • We looked at the properties of an intelligent agent and the properties of the environments in which it may operate • We introduced the intentional stance and discussed its use • Finally, we discussed what kinds of task an agent might need to carry out. 50', 'LEARNING OUTCOMES At the end of today’s lecture, you should be able to: • Recognise agent behaviours • Compare agent with objects and AI systems • Justify agents as intentional system • Identify tasks for agents 2', 'SUMMARY • Defined the main agent architectures and symbolic reasoning approach • Discussed how logic enables deductive reasoning in agents • Introduced agent-oriented programming (Agent0, PLACA, Concurrent METATEM) • Connected classical reasoning agents to modern Agentic AI systems 35', 'MEANS-ENDS REASONING / PLANNING • Planning: The design of a course of action that will achieve some desired goal • Basically, give a planning system representation of: • goal/intention to achieve; • actions it can perform; • the environment; • and generate a plan to achieve the goal 3 Let the system figure out how to achieve the goal on its own!']","According to the context, the primary goal of modern AI is ""Goal-driven collaboration"" as stated in [S1]. This means that modern AI aims to understand goals and adapt to user needs, using reasoning and creativity to co-create solutions, rather than just following fixed rules and performing predefined tasks.",Modern AI = Goal-driven collaboration,1.0,0.896170957983677,0.9999999999,1.0
