+- The deliberative subsystem handles high-level reasoning and planning using symbolic representations.
+- The reactive subsystem deals with immediate responses to changes in the environment without requiring extensive planning.
+- Both subsystems are integrated within the same agent to leverage the strengths of each approach, combining the benefits of both deliberation and reaction.
