+ 'BROOKS BEHAVIOURAL LANGUAGES Brooks proposed the following three theses: 1.Intelligent behaviour can be generated without explicit representations of the kind that symbolic AI proposes. 2.Intelligent behaviour can be generated without explicit abstract reasoning of the kind that symbolic AI proposes. 3.Intelligence is an emergent property of certain complex systems. 6Rodney Brooks: One of the most vocal critics of symbolic AI']","If you don’t feel comfortable with this definition of “intelligence”, it’s probably because you are a human.",nan,nan,nan,nan
