+{"question": "What is the primary goal of modern AI according to the lecture?", "ground_truth": "Modern AI = Goal-driven collaboration"}
+{"question": "What are the three key features of an agent according to the lecture?", "ground_truth": "An agent is a computer system that is capable of independent (autonomous) action on behalf of its user or owner"}
