+                <div class="content-grid">
+                    <div class="content-item reveal">
+                        <h3>Two-Phase Workflow</h3>
+                        <p>• Dataset preparation: generate Q&A pairs<br>• Evaluation: run through RAG pipeline<br>• Compare against ground truth<br>• Display and store results</p>
